{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方拘捕內地白牌車司機　涉非法載客跨境\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/POLICE-CAR-261109-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方拘捕一內地司機，涉嫌載客跨境。</p><p>涉事七人車被警方扣留調查。新界南交通部警員周一放蛇，喬裝乘客在網上平台叫車，由荃灣前往珠海，對方開價港幣1900元，警員登上掛有跨境牌照的私家車後表露身份，拘捕37歲內地男司機，涉非法載客取酬、駕駛時沒有第三者保險及違反逗留條件。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.206162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:09:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.088592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:34.481148+00:00","content_hash":"777cf335f0961a5afe536f64164b7e53fa28b7ed1ceee917d4f590cc9d83d84f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.206162+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}